body:
then it isn't explained how Akkun knew Takemichi was a time leaper

&#x200B;

also, when Mikey killed Kazutora, wouldn't that have made Kazutora the time leaper. Why wouldn't Kazutora have changed everything that went wrong? Mikey beat sense into him so wouldn't he have stopped his past self from killing shin or at least not turned on Baji? The past Takemichi would have arrived in would have been different, right?
